            },
            "reviewBody": "Very Tasty! Made two 8 x 8 pans instead of one big one. Reduced sugar to one cup and felt it was still a bit sweet. Used two cans of filling and two containers of cool whip. Next time I will skip Reduced Fat cream cheese and go for full fat. It was very soft. Will make again.",
