            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karin Klose"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was tasty. Next time I will use only one package of whipped topping mix and 1/2 c. of milk. I cut the powdered sugar to 2 cups but one cup would have really been enough. I was very sweet and the cream cheese flavor was masked. Will make this again but with these changes.",
