            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angela Vaughan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is great! A lot of recipes on other sites use a gram cracker crust so I was so happy to find a pecan crust. It does take a while to chill. I did one hour in the fridge and 30 min in the freezer and it turned out perfect!! Make sure you do not add the blue berry topping until after it has chilled.",
            "datePublished": "2013-11-23T18:49:43.470Z"
